{"word":"νέος","uri":"neos_(1)","senses":[{"word":"νέος","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">νέος,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">α, ον,</span> nouveau,\n<span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"Rub\"><span class=\"Ruba\">A</span> jeune :\n<div class=\"rub\"><span class=\"ruba\">I</span> <span class=\"ital\">en\nparl. de pers. particul. d’enfants, de jeunes garçons,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">13, 95 ;</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 665 ;</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Leg.</span>\n<span class=\"refpa\">890</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span>,\n<span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">de jeunes\nfilles,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Pd.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">P.</span> <span class=\"refch\">10, 92 ;</span> <span class=\"refch\">11, 40 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">de jeunes femmes,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">2, 232 ;</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span class=\"refch\">11, 447 ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">en gén. de jeunes hommes</span> (<span class=\"ital\">jusque vers la 30<span class=\"up\">e</span> année,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Mem.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">1, 2, 35</span>) <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">2, 29 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hés.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Sc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">281 ;</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">abs.</span> <span class=\"grec\">οἱ νέοι,</span>\nles jeunes, <span class=\"aut\">Ar.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Nub.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1059 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Pol.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7, 16 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">p. opp. à</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">γέρων,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">2, 789 ;</span> <span class=\"refch\">9,\n36 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Od.</span> <span